# Exercises two things evc_s076_check must handle without failing:
# a "var" row with no telegram/message open yet (skipped, not a
# failure), and a "var" row whose name is not one of ours (its bits
# are still walked to stay in sync, just not compared).
var STRAY 8 1
sequence extra
case a var row this on-board does not model
step balise group read
text: same telegram as sv1/valid.scn, with one extra trailing field
telegram 1 1 1/1 0 bits 210 a000028020008003ffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffffc0
var Q_UPDOWN 1 1
var M_VERSION 7 32
var Q_MEDIA 1 0
var N_PIG 3 0
var N_TOTAL 3 0
var M_DUP 2 0
var M_MCOUNT 8 5
var NID_C 10 1
var NID_BG 14 1
var Q_LINK 1 0
var NID_PACKET 8 0
var NID_VBCMK 6 3
var NID_PACKET 8 255
var CHECKSUM 8 0
result: accepted
